{"id":"75662f8a477e661f","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-negative-formula-self-realizability.md","title":"Self-realizability of negative arithmetic formulas","display":"thm-negative-formula-self-realizability — Self-realizability of negative arithmetic formulas","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-negative-formula-self-realizability","aliases":["72-thm-negative-formula-self-realizability"],"display":"thm-negative-formula-self-realizability — Self-realizability of negative arithmetic formulas","depends_on":["[[72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment]]","[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, Lemma 1.10 (i)-(ii), proof, printed p. 415, PDF p. 427","source_relation":"External standard-model specialization to the explicitly negative fragment; no claim of an internal HA-star formal proof","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-proof-sketch-checked","source_proof_status":"Source canonical-realizer recursion checked against page image; local simultaneous induction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-negative-formula-self-realizability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-negative-formula-self-realizability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-negative-formula-self-realizability — Self-realizability of negative arithmetic formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb78d8a03236bc57\" href=\"?note=bb78d8a03236bc57\" title=\"72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment\">72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, Lemma 1.10 (i)-(ii), proof, printed p. 415, PDF p. 427"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"External standard-model specialization to the explicitly negative fragment; no claim of an internal HA-star formal proof"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-proof-sketch-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Source canonical-realizer recursion checked against page image; local simultaneous induction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal A_a^{-}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a^{-}\">\\(\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb78d8a03236bc57\" href=\"?note=bb78d8a03236bc57\" title=\"72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment\">72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment</a> 定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}\">\\(\\mathsf{NR}\\)</span>、可接受编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 及配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a> 的固定结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AT}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a>。</li>\n<li>编号与参数化条件取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SMN}\">\\(\\operatorname{SMN}\\)</span>；固定有限参数的选码函数要求总递归，不对任意可接受编号附加未声明的原始递归选码条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta))\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta))\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同时对负公式结构归纳证明两方向，并将第二方向加强为：对每个固定公式 B，有一个对其有限自由数值参数全定义的递归构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_B\">\\(c_B\\)</span>，当 B 为真时它给出 B 的实现者。该加强陈述避免在全称步骤从逐点存在直接跳到可计算的一致选择。</p>\n<p>原子及假公式取常数 0：真等式可由任意数实现，假公式的第二方向前件不成立。合取取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(c_B,c_C)\">\\(p(c_B,c_C)\\)</span>，两个方向由投影与归纳假设得到。全称取计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\mapsto c_B(\\eta[i\\mapsto m])\">\\(m\\mapsto c_B(\\eta[i\\mapsto m])\\)</span> 的程序索引；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 使它统一依赖外部有限参数，且矩阵构造全定义，所以该索引在每个 m 上终止。反向从每个输出的归纳假设得到全称真值。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\to_a C\">\\(B\\to_a C\\)</span>，典范实现者是忽略输入、返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_C\">\\(c_C\\)</span> 的常值程序索引。若该蕴涵为真，且输入实现 B，则第一方向归纳假设给出 B 真，因此 C 真，返回的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_C\">\\(c_C\\)</span> 实现 C。反向若某个 e 实现蕴涵，并假定 B 真，则第二方向归纳假设给出 B 的实现者；e 在该输入上输出 C 的实现者，第一方向归纳假设推出 C 真。整个递归只涉及原子、合取、全称、蕴涵，与来源 p.415 的典范实现者证明一致。</p>\n<p>归纳没有处理任意析取或存在公式，它们被精确片段定义排除。未把本结论误扩展为所有 NR 公式的真值蕴涵，也未把经典真值等同于 HA 可证明性。本地论证依赖明确声明的标准可接受编号性质；未运行机器证明，未复核原书 Lemma 1.10 的 (iii)-(iv)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"bb78d8a03236bc57","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnc